{
  "movie_id": 516000601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 6.0,
      "end_time": 9.7,
      "text": "...Now's my chance to quietl esc-..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 10.9,
      "end_time": 12.1,
      "text": "Eek!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 15.5,
      "end_time": 17.2,
      "text": "Where do you think you're going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 17.4,
      "end_time": 20.3,
      "text": "Now then, how about you give us some answers already?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 20.6,
      "end_time": 22.4,
      "text": "Medusa sisters... where are they?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 23.0,
      "end_time": 25.7,
      "text": "EEEEK! A-As if I'd know!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 25.9,
      "end_time": 28.6,
      "text": "I was just fueling that little girl's ambition!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 28.8,
      "end_time": 33.0,
      "text": "There's no way I'd know anything about her or her sisters!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 33.6,
      "end_time": 38.4,
      "text": "*sigh*... It's a serious crime to disturb a peaceful New Year's"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 39.0,
      "end_time": 40.5,
      "text": "...What do you want to do with her?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 43.1,
      "end_time": 47.2,
      "text": "I don't care. I couldn't find any lead on my sisters..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 47.5,
      "end_time": 49.3,
      "text": "And I'm sure that's not going to change..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 49.7,
      "end_time": 51.4,
      "text": "Stand up, Medusa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 51.8,
      "end_time": 53.5,
      "text": "I'm sure you're sad and frustrated"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 53.7,
      "end_time": 57.3,
      "text": "But nothing will change if you just surrender and bow your head!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 57.6,
      "end_time": 58.8,
      "text": "Stand up and face forward!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 60.0,
      "end_time": 65.2,
      "text": "I know... But I can't do anything on my own..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 66.3,
      "end_time": 67.3,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 75.2,
      "end_time": 76.4,
      "text": "Huh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 77.2,
      "end_time": 82.4,
      "text": "WHAT THE HELL'S WRONG WITH YOUUUUUUUUUU?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 84.7,
      "end_time": 89.7,
      "text": "What do you want? \nHurry up and return home like the other snakes"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 94.5,
      "end_time": 98.0,
      "text": "Wait... you're lonely too, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 100.6,
      "end_time": 104.8,
      "text": "Now that I think about it, I was in your stomach"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 105.2,
      "end_time": 107.6,
      "text": "So you must've heard anything..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 110.7,
      "end_time": 113.2,
      "text": "Then, how about becoming my familiar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 113.9,
      "end_time": 117.0,
      "text": "If you accept, I'll give you this."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 118.1,
      "end_time": 121.2,
      "text": "Are you sure? That's important to you, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 122.1,
      "end_time": 126.1,
      "text": "It's fine. If it's to find my sisters, I'll give up anything"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 130.0,
      "end_time": 131.3,
      "text": "Shahー!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 131.6,
      "end_time": 136.5,
      "text": "A contract has been made. Ah, you're part of my familiar now, you need a name"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 137.2,
      "end_time": 140.9,
      "text": "Medu... si... Anna..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 141.4,
      "end_time": 142.9,
      "text": "Medusiana!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 143.2,
      "end_time": 145.0,
      "text": "Starting today, you're Medusiana!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 145.5,
      "end_time": 146.4,
      "text": "Wahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 148.5,
      "end_time": 152.1,
      "text": "I'm counting on you, Medusiana"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 153.5,
      "end_time": 156.0,
      "text": "Hehe. It seems like things have been solved"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 156.3,
      "end_time": 157.3,
      "text": "Yeah, you're right"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 157.5,
      "end_time": 159.5,
      "text": "Wait, w-whoa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 162.9,
      "end_time": 166.3,
      "text": "This is a special seat, I'll have you know. Be grateful."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 170.2,
      "end_time": 172.7,
      "text": "In the end, another big mess has been dealt with"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 173.1,
      "end_time": 175.1,
      "text": "But... it wasn't all for naught"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 175.3,
      "end_time": 177.1,
      "text": "Yeah, that was fun"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 177.4,
      "end_time": 178.3,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 178.6,
      "end_time": 182.6,
      "text": "W-Wait, you're too close, too close!"
    }
  ],
